Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.22,0:02:09.77,OPTC,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}{\be3\1c&H3B343E&\3c&HE2EDF5&}{\t(320,361,1,\1c&H3D464A&\3c&H408141&)}{\t(778,1738,1,\1c&HC28147&\3c&HE9B997&)}{\t(2614,3781,1,\1c&H625A2B&\3c&HA7C08C&)}{\t(4324,4365,1,\1c&H8C77C0&\3c&HC5BBE9&)}{\t(5825,5867,1,\1c&HE96B0E&\3c&HF4AD4F&)}唯有你　唯有你
